                                                "sense_id": "b4c2df5b-d1d1-3857-a4ab-d3151daccd3c",
                                                "text": "In another moment a huge wave, like a muddy tidal bore, but almost scaldingly hot, came sweeping round the bend up-stream."
                                            }
